  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7cdaee43ffca7cb4ba1aba307f7d4c1b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  buttons:
  - {fileID: 766933177}
  - {fileID: 1464183884}
  - {fileID: 452860373}
  - {fileID: 1760886872}
  - {fileID: 639110330}
  texts:
  - Normal as usual. Why you need to read all of this information?
  - Here you get the random amount of notebooks, items, etc.
  - Choose the custom settings of the game, like manage the amount of notebooks.
  - It's just you and Baldi in this challenge. The catch is, both of you move super
    fast! Can you think fast enough to collect 9 notebooks and escape the school?
  - You've snuck in school after hours! Surely Principal of the Things will be after
    you. Use invisible potions (7 seconds each), lockers, and your map to avoid being
    seen and collect 7 notebooks.
  text: {fileID: 933013685}
