  - {fileID: 1637472337}
  - {fileID: 1021188035}
  texts:
  - Default mode. This is usually where you get story and endless mode.
  - Go camping with baldi. Collect firewoods and survive the night.
  - Go to the farm with baldi. There's two different places where you can go.
  - Actual hide and seek game with Baldi on the school. Fun little minigame you can
    try!
  - Normal mode but Baldi as another player. This mode is beta so some stuff may
    not work as intended.
  - This is basically normal mode except it's BIRTHDAY BASH!
  text: {fileID: 2106001297}
